This kit reads the event stream of "agent-flow" (npm package agent-flow-app,
https://github.com/patoles/agent-flow, Apache License 2.0, Copyright by its
authors, "patoles" on GitHub). It does not bundle, copy or modify agent-flow:
the relay is started on demand with `npx agent-flow-app@0.9.1`.

The visual-effects techniques in public/tlfx.js (a blurred bloom pass,
cached radial-gradient glow sprites, a parallax starfield, a hex-grid backdrop,
glowing trail particles and spinner arcs) were studied from agent-flow's
webview client and re-implemented from scratch. No agent-flow source code
was copied. Credit and thanks to the agent-flow authors.

